{
  "notes": "Stock lane overlay (ADR-0230..0233), layered over workflow.json via --args. stocks-opt: universe B, 2024-01-18..2026-08-25 (the option-trade window). Per-ticker values are one pattern over the lane ('*' with {lane}/{lane_lower}); nothing is typed per ticker except the ticker list, which a pin test ties to configs/stock_universe.json minus the refused HES. Reader price_calendar: one row per price date, no option surface, so option-surface families are dropped (families.drop), the option reference model is left unreferenced, and acceptance/decision_regions are null (the verdict is the per-ticker CRPS rollup vs horizon_empirical). selection.metric crps because the decision loss needs decision_regions. DHR carries explicit windows on its two spin-off days (2016-07-05 Fortive, 2023-10-02 Veralto); the dividend-yield/jump rule would catch them too. The option-surface inputs (feature_sources.surface/lifecycle/chain_features, chain_proxy, surface_features, matched_dte_vrp) are null: the price_calendar reader refuses them. families.attach.agree_fields drops chain_atm_iv and rn_q_*: a stock panel has no option surface to agree on. families.columns is the base list without chain_atm_iv (the reader of a stock panel has no such column); the dropped families' fields are removed from it by families.drop. families.drop also names the carried entry oi_panel_columns (option open-interest panel columns). settlement_date, spot, terminal_price and reference_scale join agree_fields and columns: a stock cohort is the reader's own rows (no prepared option panel to supply them), and step 3 reads settlement_date from the step 1b panel. feature_limits.wing_metrics is false: the wing metrics read decision_regions context, which a stock lane has none of (the wing_twcrps training loss does not need it). feature_order.names is empty so the hook derives the order (core names, task feature, family fields): the recorded QQQ/IWM list names option-chain columns a stock panel lacks. panel_schema.decision_context is null: with no decision_regions the study config carries no decision_context key (templates mark it optional).",
